    "crmNotes": "Flow key send_quote_pdf. After generate, POST /files/{outputFileId}/link onto message, then mark sent. Use downloadUrl as WhatsApp/Email attachment. Env: BFF_URL, N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET, CRM_N8N_*, OPPORTUNITY_QUOTE_TEMPLATE_ID."
